Project goal

Simulate a real Application Support incident:

“User is unable to access files in an Azure Blob Storage container.”

Let us troubleshoot the issue and resolve it using Azure RBAC.

We'll create a realistic support ticket:

INC001 — User unable to access application files

Symptom:
User can access the Azure Storage account but cannot read blobs.

User reports access issue
        ↓
Check Storage Account
        ↓
Check Container
        ↓
Check User Identity
        ↓
Check RBAC Assignment
        ↓
Identify Missing Permission
        ↓
Assign appropriate Storage Blob role
        ↓
Retest
        ↓
Access restored
